  "description": "Top of the range. The Vice FS 3.0 is our love, a precedent for Reid and a true example of the quality we can bring at a great price. Worldwide experience and knowledge have been drawn on to tailor this bike to provide you with a fast and playful ride that climbs like a mountain goat and grabs the trail like a vice. Looking for a seriously good time in the dirt? Look no further.\n27+ is the latest progression in Mountain Biking. Our Vice range are built with all the new features and standards that make this exciting new category so much fun. Meet the new Vice FS 3.0 – our new flagship mountain bike with all the features you’d expect from a top-flight full-suspension trail rig.\nThe Vice FS 3.0 is built around a double/triple butted frame with 4-bar linkage system from frame gurus Kinesis. More so, the bike has front/rear full-suspension provided by RockShox, 1×10 gearing from Shimano SLX and FSA Comet crank. Riders will also experience the fine control and stopping power of Shimano M615 hydraulic discs.\nReady to step up to a full suspension 27+ Plus Mountain Bike? The Vice FS 3.0 features some rock solid spec choices and some very special extras.",
